<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee may determine its own procedure and shall make the reporting to the Board accordingly."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~part_III__cl_14__subsec_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~part_III__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
