<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23> <https://schema.org/text> "No action, suit, prosecution or other proceedings shall be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against the Board or any committee established by the Board on account of or in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by them in the course of carrying out their duties under this Act unless it can be proven that the act, neglect or default was done or omitted in bad faith and without reasonable cause."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
