<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall meet at least once in every three months at such times and places as the Chairman may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
