<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chairman is absent at any meeting of the Board, the Chairman may direct the Deputy Chairman to replace him as the chairperson of the meeting and if the Chairman and the Deputy Chairman are absent, the Board shall elect from among themselves to preside at the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
