<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The quorum of the Board for the meetings shall be eleven members, including the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/63/eng@> .
